See the [launch announcement](https://blog.google/technology/developers/google-gemma-2/) for more details. Usage of Gemma is subject to Google''s [Gemma Terms of Use](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms).', NULL, false, 'openrouter', 'chat', NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', '{"units": [{"name": "textInput", "rate": 0.03, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}, {"name": "textOutput", "rate": 0.09, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}]}', '{}', NULL, '{"video": false, "search": false, "vision": false, "reasoning": false, "imageOutput": false, "functionCall": false}', 8192, 'remote', '2024-06-28', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.231+00');
INSERT INTO public.ai_models VALUES ('sao10k/l3-euryale-70b', 'Llama 3 Euryale 70B v2.1', 'Euryale 70B v2.1 is a model focused on creative roleplay from [Sao10k](https://ko-fi.com/sao10k).

- Better prompt adherence.
- Better anatomy / spatial awareness.
- Adapts much better to unique and custom formatting / reply formats.
- Very creative, lots of unique swipes.
- Is not restrictive during roleplays.', NULL, false, 'openrouter', 'chat', NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', '{"units": [{"name": "textInput", "rate": 1.48, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}, {"name": "textOutput", "rate": 1.48, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}]}', '{}', NULL, '{"video": false, "search": false, "vision": false, "reasoning": false, "imageOutput": false, "functionCall": true}', 8192, 'remote', '2024-06-18', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.231+00');
INSERT INTO public.ai_models VALUES ('nousresearch/hermes-2-pro-llama-3-8b', 'Hermes 2 Pro - Llama-3 8B', 'Hermes 2 Pro is an upgraded, retrained version of Nous Hermes 2, consisting of an updated and cleaned version of the OpenHermes 2.5 Dataset, as well as a newly introduced Function Calling and JSON Mode dataset developed in-house.', NULL, false, 'openrouter', 'chat', NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', '{"units": [{"name": "textInput", "rate": 0.14, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}, {"name": "textOutput", "rate": 0.14, "unit": "millionTokens", "strategy": "fixed"}]}', '{}', NULL, '{"video": false, "search": false, "vision": false, "reasoning": false, "imageOutput": false, "functionCall": false}', 8192, 'remote', '2024-05-27', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.249579+00', '2026-01-26 16:41:26.231+00');
