7890, ensures uniqueness for idempotent operations.  \n\n## Locating Screenshot File  \n- The screenshot’s relative path is \"../tmp/playwright-mcp-output/1769508027920/screenshot-oriolrius-me.png,\" suggesting storage in /tmp/."}', NULL, '{"tps": 81.66401404972284, "ttft": 17341, "latency": 35562, "duration": 18221, "totalTokens": 386624, "inputTextTokens": 385136, "outputTextTokens": 47, "totalInputTokens": 385136, "inputCachedTokens": 148, "totalOutputTokens": 1488, "inputCacheMissTokens": 384988, "outputReasoningTokens": 1441}', NULL, NULL, NULL);
