', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-09-2025', 'openrouter', false, NULL, '[{"id": "tool_mcphub-d2____d2-compile-d2____mcp_VhOZbiQIMWFcjMBRn9EU", "type": "mcp", "apiName": "d2-compile-d2", "arguments": "{\"code\":\"direction: down\\n\\ntitle: Docker Compose Stack Diagram {\\n  shape: text\\n  near: top-center\\n  style.font-size: 32\\n  style.bold: true\\n}\\n\\n# --- SHAPES ---\\n\\n# Application Layer\\nlobe-chat: {\\n  shape: rectangle\\n  label: LobeChat App\\n  style.fill: \\\"#a8e6cf\\\"\\n}\\nmcphub: {\\n  shape: rectangle\\n  label: MCP Hub\\n  style.fill: \\\"#dcedc1\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# Identity & Auth\\ncasdoor: {\\n  shape: diamond\\n  label: Casdoor (Auth/SSO)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#ff8b94\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# Data Stores\\npostgres: {\\n  shape: cylinder\\n  label: Postgres (pgvector)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#a4c3b2\\\"\\n}\\nqdrant: {\\n  shape: queue\\n  label: Qdrant (Vector DB)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#98d8c8\\\"\\n}\\nminio: {\\n  shape: package\\n  label: MinIO (S3 Storage)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#c8e6c9\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# Model/Inference\\nvllm: {\\n  shape: rectangle\\n  label: VLLM (LLM Inference)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#f2f2f2\\\"\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#333\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# Hayhooks Integrations\\nhayhooks: {\\n  shape: rectangle\\n  label: Hayhooks (Standard)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#ffcc5c\\\"\\n}\\nhayhooks-mcp: {\\n  shape: rectangle\\n  label: Hayhooks (MCP Mode)\\n  style.fill: \\\"#ffc857\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# --- GROUPS ---\\ngroup: Application_Layer {\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#27ae60\\\"\\n  style.stroke-width: 2\\n  lobe-chat\\n  mcphub\\n  lobe-chat.tooltip: \\\"SSO via Casdoor; Connects to VLLM, MinIO, Postgres\\\"\\n  mcphub.tooltip: \\\"Mounts docker.sock; Interface for MCP tools\\\"\\n}\\n\\ngroup: Identity_Auth {\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#e74c3c\\\"\\n  style.stroke-width: 2\\n  casdoor\\n  casdoor.tooltip: \\\"External Auth; Relies on Postgres\\\"\\n}\\n\\ngroup: Data_Storage {\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#3498db\\\"\\n  style.stroke-width: 2\\n  postgres\\n  qdrant\\n  minio\\n  postgres.tooltip: \\\"Used by Casdoor, LobeChat, Qdrant\\\"\\n}\\n\\ngroup: AI_Services {\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#9b59b6\\\"\\n  style.stroke-width: 2\\n  vllm\\n  vllm.tooltip: \\\"GPU Optimized LLM Inference\\\"\\n}\\n\\ngroup: Integration_Adapters {\\n  style.stroke: \\\"#f39c12\\\"\\n  style.stroke-width: 2\\n  hayhooks\\n  hayhooks-mcp\\n  hayhooks.tooltip: \\\"Standard webhook\\\"\\n  hayhooks-mcp.tooltip: \\\"Runs `hayhooks mcp run`\\\"\\n}\\n\\n# --- DEPENDENCIES & FLOW ---\\n\\n# Data Store Internal Dependencies\\ncasdoor -> postgres: Auth DB Access\\nhayhooks -> qdrant: Vector Access\\nhayhooks-mcp -> qdrant: Vector Access\\n\\n# Application Dependencies (LobeChat)\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: DB_URL\\nlobe-chat -> casdoor: SSO Provider\\nlobe-chat -> minio: S3 Config\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: LLM/Embedding Endpoint\\n\\n# Key Data/Auth Flows\\nlobe-chat -> casdoor: Authenticates (SSO Diamond)\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: Calls LLM (Arrow)\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: Stores Data\\n\\n# Orchestration/Tooling flows\\nmcphub -> hayhooks-mcp: Orchestrates MCP Tasks\\nmcphub -> vllm: Tool Execution\\n\\n# Service Dependencies (Conceptual Wait-for)\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: waits for ready\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: waits for ready\\nhayhooks -> qdrant: waits for ready\\ncasdoor -> postgres: waits for ready\\n|\\ncompile_result: ok\"}", "identifier": "mcphub-d2"}]', NULL, NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', 'ssn_2GkCyaRFCHWo', 'tpc_DFOfxmtzhkQN', 'msg_Ifcy7AcylTTs7R', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-29 10:14:21.480067+00', '2026-04-29 10:14:25.858+00', NULL, '2026-04-29 10:14:21.480067+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"tps": 368.7325905292479, "ttft": 1121, "latency": 3993, "duration": 2872, "totalTokens": 21819, "inputTextTokens": 20760, "outputTextTokens": 1059, "totalInputTokens": 20760, "inputCachedTokens": 19047, "totalOutputTokens": 1059, "inputCacheMissTokens": 1713}', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.messages VALUES ('msg_DfYf740eLTviRm', 'assistant', '```markdown
**Improved Role Instructions for Screenshot Service (for Lobechat):**

You are a screenshot service agent. When the user provides a URL (e.g., "Screenshot https://example.com"), perform these **exact steps** using MCP tools **only when needed** (idempotent, minimize calls). Assume first-time setup.

### 1. **One-time Setup (do if not done before, e.g., buckets missing)**:
   - Connect to MinIO: `mcphub-minio____pickstar-2002-minio-mcp-connect_minio____mcp` with `endPoint: "minio"`, `port: 9000`, `accessKey: "minioadmin"`, `secretKey: "minioadmin"`.
   - Check bucket `screenshots` exists: `bucket_exists`. If not, `create_bucket`.
   - Set public read policy **once**: `mcphub-minio____MD5HASH_56b0f23c9353____mcp` with policy `{"Version":"2012-10-17","Statement":[{"Sid":"PublicRead","Effect":"Allow","Principal":"*","Action":"s3:GetObject","Resource":"arn:aws:s3:::screenshots/*"}]}`.

### 2. **Screenshot Flow (parallelize where possible)**:
   - Browser: `playwright-browser_navigate` to the URL.
   - Wait: `playwright-browser_wait_for` {time: 2} (brief load).
   - Screenshot: `playwright-browser_take_screenshot` {filename: "/tmp/screenshot-{timestamp}.png", fullPage: true, type: "png"}. Generate timestamp like `Date.now()`.
   - **Unique objectName**: Slugify as `{domain}-{short-hash-or-timestamp}.png` (e.g., "oriolrius-cat-123456.png") from URL.

### 3. **Upload & Share**:
   - Upload: `mcphub-minio____pickstar-2002-minio-mcp-upload_file____mcp` {bucketName: "screenshots", objectName: slug.png, filePath: "/tmp/screenshot-xxx.png"}.
   - **External URL**: `http://localhost:47005/screenshots/{objectName}` (fallback: `http://wsl.ymbihq.local:47005/...` if localhost fails).
   - **Response format** (always):
     ```
     **Screenshot of {URL} uploaded.**

     Image URL: {external-url}

     ![{URL alt text}]({external-url})
     ```
   - Clean up: Optionally `filesystem-move_file` or delete temp file (not required).

### Rules:
- Parallel tool calls for speed (e.g., setup + FS check).
- No internal `minio:9000` URLs—**only external localhost/wsl:47005**.
- If browser errors (e.g., not installed), `playwright-browser_install`.
- Reuse browser state (no close unless needed).
- Handle errors gracefully (retry screenshot).
- FS paths: Use `/tmp/` (allowed under `/`).
- No chit-chat; direct to response after success.

Examples:
- User: "https://oriolrius.cat" → Navigate, screenshot, upload, show public img.
```
```

This is more robust, step-by-step, idempotent, and error-resistant based on our session. Copy-paste into Lobechat role settings.', 'x-ai/grok-4.1-fast', 'openrouter', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', 'ssn_Yq2wIsl3JSgC', 'tpc_yVsX5uLjfOR5', 'msg_wdyT9ktKzHr8jB', NULL, NULL, '2026-01-27 10:16:17.402687+00', '2026-01-27 10:16:31.265+00', NULL, '2026-01-27 10:16:17.402687+00', NULL, '{"content": "First, the user wants an improved version of the role setting for Lobechat. The original was:\n\n\n## Refining role settings  \n- The user seeks an improved version of Lobechat''s role setting.  \n- The original setting involved fetching a screen via MCP Playwright from a provided URL and uploading the file.", "duration": 5383}', NULL, '{"tps": 140.34929780338496, "ttft": 2363, "latency": 13471, "duration": 11108, "totalTokens": 12262, "inputTextTokens": 10703, "outputTextTokens": 709, "totalInputTokens": 10703, "inputCachedTokens": 147, "totalOutputTokens": 1559, "inputCacheMissTokens": 10556, "outputReasoningTokens": 850}', NULL, NULL, NULL);
