# --- DEPENDENCIES & FLOW ---
casdoor -> postgres: Auth DB
hayhooks -> qdrant: Vector Access
hayhooks-mcp -> qdrant: Vector Access

lobe-chat -> postgres: DB URL
lobe-chat -> casdoor: SSO
lobe-chat -> minio: S3 Config
