ooks -> qdrant: Vector Access\\nhayhooks-mcp -> qdrant: Vector Access\\n\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: DB_URL\\nlobe-chat -> casdoor: SSO Provider\\nlobe-chat -> minio: S3 Config\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: LLM/Embedding Endpoint\\n\\nlobe-chat -> casdoor: Authenticates (SSO)\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: Calls LLM\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: Stores Data\\n\\nmcphub -> hayhooks-mcp: Orchestrates MCP Tasks\\nmcphub -> vllm: Tool Execution\\n\\nlobe-chat -> postgres: waits for ready\\nlobe-chat -> vllm: waits for ready\\nhayhooks -> qdrant: waits for ready\\ncasdoor -> postgres: waits for ready\\n|\"}", "identifier": "mcphub-d2"}]', NULL, NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', 'ssn_2GkCyaRFCHWo', 'tpc_DFOfxmtzhkQN', 'msg_p3NriVnsJ0YF5G', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-29 10:15:19.961224+00', '2026-04-29 10:15:26.656+00', NULL, '2026-04-29 10:15:19.961224+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"tps": 328.00154172287534, "ttft": 1072, "latency": 6261, "duration": 5189, "totalTokens": 20156, "inputTextTokens": 18454, "outputTextTokens": 1702, "totalInputTokens": 18454, "totalOutputTokens": 1702, "inputCacheMissTokens": 18454}', NULL, NULL, NULL);
