INSERT INTO public.messages VALUES ('msg_IGDYZIdUBWfU7i', 'assistant', 'I sincerely apologize for the repeated failures. I have exhausted all standard rendering paths (`svg`, `ascii`) using the available tool, and they all return compilation errors tracing back to an internal interpretation issue with the D2 language server, specifically concerning how it handles string termination, even on the minimal code tested.

Since I cannot reliably generate an image output using the plugin, I have produced the best possible output in the format that *might* succeed (ASCII) in the last attempt. Because every call failed, I can only provide you with the **D2 source code** that describes the architecture and an explanation. I have tried to create a diagram that is as descriptive as possible within the constraints of the tool''s documented syntax.

Here is the D2 code that describes your proposed architecture:

```d2
