INSERT INTO public.messages VALUES ('msg_dpEGXqjEjFfrHI', 'assistant', 'Here is the grounded answer (markdown artifact):

<lobeThinking>This is a new, shorter artifact — a standalone abstract document. It''s self-contained and distinct from the prior detailed comparison. New identifier warranted.</lobeThinking>

<lobeArtifact identifier="rag-abstract" type="text/markdown" title="Abstract — Naive vs. Advanced vs. Modular RAG (Gao et al. 2023)">
# Abstract: RAG Paradigm Comparison — Gao et al. (2023)

Gao et al. (2023) categorize the evolution of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) into three successive paradigms. **Naive RAG** is the earliest approach, following a fixed linear pipeline of indexing, retrieval, and generation ("Retrieve-Read"), but suffers from poor retrieval precision, hallucination, and noisy context passing. **Advanced RAG** addresses these shortcomings by wrapping the same chain-like structure with pre-retrieval optimizations (query rewriting, metadata-enriched indexing) and post-retrieval refinements (re-ranking, context compression), improving quality without restructuring the pipeline. **Modular RAG** goes furthest, decomposing the system into interchangeable, composable modules — including Search, Memory, Routing, Predict, and Task Adapter — and enabling non-sequential patterns such as iterative, adaptive, and hybrid retrieval. Each paradigm builds on the last, trading simplicity for flexibility and capability.
</lobeArtifact>', 'claude-sonnet-4-6', 'anthropic', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4ee2c53f-bbd1-4a47-bb39-98f018730d41', 'ssn_RagSage01', 'tpc_ImYsdPrs334Z', 'msg_LRqA3U0AE437wA', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-29 11:23:03.954556+00', '2026-04-29 11:23:11.581+00', NULL, '2026-04-29 11:23:03.954556+00', NULL, '{"content": "The user wants a shorter abstract/summary version of the previous artifact.", "duration": 537, "signature": ""}', NULL, '{"tps": 100.62728698379509, "ttft": 3011, "latency": 6837, "duration": 3826, "totalTokens": 32154, "totalInputTokens": 31769, "inputCachedTokens": 28870, "totalOutputTokens": 385, "inputCacheMissTokens": 3, "inputWriteCacheTokens": 2896}', NULL, NULL, NULL);
