<lobeThinking>This request is a simple iteration on the previous prompt, requiring a new, highly minimalist text-based logo/wordmark. It is self-contained and requires a visual representation to fulfill the request. This is a new design, so I will create a new artifact.</lobeThinking>

<lobeArtifact identifier="minimal-logotype-v2" type="image/svg+xml" title="Minimalist Typographic Logo">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 300 80" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
